    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_AutoRetry">Retry failed downloads</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_AutoRetryHint">After a download has failed, OB2 can start it again on its own, waiting longer before each attempt. Useful for a queue left running overnight. Errors that cannot be fixed by trying again, such as a wrong checksum or a missing file, are never retried.</sys:String>
