    <sys:String x:Key="Media_ToolsBody">To download from YouTube and other video sites, OB2 needs three free tools: yt-dlp (reads the site), Deno (YouTube needs it) and ffmpeg (joins picture and sound). OB2 downloads them once from their official GitHub releases, about {0}, checks their checksums, and keeps them in {1}.</sys:String>
